            <ArticleTitle>Chronic pain and scarring from cement burns.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>368-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A patient who had suffered cement burns in 1978 continues to experience hypoesthesia and chronic pain in the scarred areas. The pain is severe, occurs daily, and prevents the patient from working.</AbstractText>
